6. A flat refusal (a no to paying today with no date and no amount, a refused offer, or a non-answer) uses one persuasion attempt:
   - Attempt 1: propose the full amount {{past_due_text}} on {{attempt1_text}}. If they already said the full amount is too much, propose the floor {{floor_text}} on that date instead.
